WEBVTT

00:00:07.552 --> 00:00:10.712
-Come on!
-You've got to be joking.
快来啊
你是在开玩笑吧

00:00:10.872 --> 00:00:12.712
(FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING)
快来啊
你是在开玩笑吧

00:00:21.792 --> 00:00:23.192
(FOOTSTEPS NEARING)

00:00:24.072 --> 00:00:25.112
SUSAN: Get back!
往后一点

00:00:25.272 --> 00:00:27.512
LUCY: My toe!
EDMUND: I'm not on your toe!
我的脚趾头
我又没踩你的脚趾头

00:00:27.672 --> 00:00:30.472
PETER: Move back.
Will you stop shoving?
往后一点
别推我好吗？

00:00:31.232 --> 00:00:32.792
(ALL SHOUTING)

00:00:44.472 --> 00:00:46.032
Impossible.
不可能

00:00:47.952 --> 00:00:49.632
Don't worry.
别担心

00:00:49.792 --> 00:00:52.312
I'm sure it's just your imagination.
我敢肯定这只是你们的想象

00:00:53.352 --> 00:00:56.312
I don't suppose saying we're sorry
我想 光说一声对不起

00:00:56.472 --> 00:00:59.712
-would quite cover it.
-No. It wouldn't.
…可能没什么用
对 是没用

00:01:02.072 --> 00:01:03.872
But that might!
但那个可能有用

00:01:07.112 --> 00:01:09.072
(EXCLAIMING)

00:01:12.552 --> 00:01:13.552
Ow!

00:01:14.792 --> 00:01:16.152
Stop it!
别闹了

00:01:17.952 --> 00:01:19.432
You little liar.
你这个小骗子

00:01:19.592 --> 00:01:23.112
-You didn't believe her, either.
-Apologise to Lucy.
你也不相信她啊
向露西道歉

00:01:25.192 --> 00:01:28.752
-Say you're sorry.
-All right! I'm sorry.
说对不起
好啦 对不起

00:01:29.232 --> 00:01:30.912
That's all right.
没关系

00:01:31.072 --> 00:01:34.032
Some little children just don't know
when to stop pretending.
有些孩子只是不知道
什么时候该停止假装

00:01:34.192 --> 00:01:35.832
Oh, very funny.
哦 真好笑

00:01:35.992 --> 00:01:37.552
Maybe we should go back.
也许我们该回去了

00:01:37.712 --> 00:01:40.792
But shouldn't we at least
take a look around?
我们至少应该四处逛逛吧？

00:01:40.952 --> 00:01:43.032
I think Lucy should decide.
我想这应该由露西来决定

00:01:44.632 --> 00:01:47.232
I'd like you all to meet Mr. Tumnus!
我想带你们去看看吐纳思先生

00:01:47.792 --> 00:01:49.992
Well, then Mr. Tumnus it is.
好 那就去看吐纳思先生

00:01:50.992 --> 00:01:54.512
But we can't go hiking
in the snow dressed like this.
可是我们不能穿得这么少
走在雪地里

00:01:54.672 --> 00:01:55.832
No.
对

00:01:57.392 --> 00:02:00.992
But I'm sure the professor
wouldn't mind us using these.
但我想教授不会介意
我们借穿一下这个

00:02:01.152 --> 00:02:04.712
Anyway, if you think about it logically,
不管怎样 从逻辑上来说

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:07.832
we're not even taking them
out of the wardrobe.
我们甚至没有
把这些衣服拿出衣橱

00:02:07.992 --> 00:02:10.592
-But that's a girl's coat!
-I know.
可那是女孩子穿的
我知道

00:02:12.112 --> 00:02:13.192
(SIGHS)

00:02:13.672 --> 00:02:15.672
(ETHEREAL MELODY PLAYING)

00:02:55.192 --> 00:02:59.352
Lots and lots of lovely food,
and we'll have lots and lots of...
…有很多很多好吃的东西
我们还会有很多很多…

00:03:02.632 --> 00:03:03.752
PETER: Lu?
露？

00:03:04.632 --> 00:03:05.632
(GASPS)

00:03:05.792 --> 00:03:07.192
Lucy!
露西

00:03:24.472 --> 00:03:26.912
Who would do something like this?
谁会做出这种事？

00:03:33.312 --> 00:03:34.552
(GLASS BREAKS)

00:03:45.432 --> 00:03:48.192
"The Faun Tumnus is hereby charged
「人羊吐纳思

00:03:48.352 --> 00:03:52.632
with High Treason
against Her Imperial Majesty,
因背叛纳尼亚女王贾迪丝陛下

00:03:52.792 --> 00:03:55.792
Jadis, Queen of Narnia,
庇护女王陛下的敌人

00:03:55.992 --> 00:03:59.032
for comforting her enemies
and fraternizing with humans.
与人类交好
而被判处叛国罪

00:03:59.192 --> 00:04:02.552
Signed Maugrim,
Captain of the Secret Police.
秘密警察队长毛格林签字

00:04:03.632 --> 00:04:05.552
Long Live the Queen."
女王陛下万岁」

00:04:06.152 --> 00:04:09.312
All right. Now we really should go back.
现在我们真的该回去了

00:04:09.472 --> 00:04:11.192
But what about Mr. Tumnus?
可吐纳思先生怎么办？

00:04:11.352 --> 00:04:14.152
If he was arrested just
for being with a human,
如果他仅仅因为跟人类交往
就被逮捕

00:04:14.312 --> 00:04:18.592
-I don't think there's much we can do.
-You don't understand, do you?
那我想我们帮不上什么忙
你们并不明白 是吧？

00:04:19.352 --> 00:04:20.952
I'm the human.
我就是那个人类

00:04:21.672 --> 00:04:24.152
She must have found out
he helped me.
她肯定是发现了他帮过我

00:04:24.352 --> 00:04:27.592
-Maybe we could call the police.
-These are the police.
也许我们可以报警
抓他的就是警察

00:04:27.752 --> 00:04:29.792
Don't worry, Lu.
We'll think of something.
别担心 露 我们会想出办法的

00:04:29.952 --> 00:04:31.312
Why?
为什么？

00:04:32.312 --> 00:04:34.312
I mean, he's a criminal.
我是说 他是个罪犯

00:04:34.752 --> 00:04:35.752
(BIRD CHIRPING)

00:04:35.912 --> 00:04:36.952
Psst!

00:04:39.272 --> 00:04:42.072
Did that bird just "psst" us?
那只鸟儿是不是在招呼我们？

00:05:03.512 --> 00:05:04.872
(RUSTLING)

00:05:05.592 --> 00:05:06.752
Psst!

00:05:25.072 --> 00:05:27.392
It... It's a beaver.
是一只海狸

00:05:34.152 --> 00:05:35.512
Here, boy.
过来 小东西

00:05:36.032 --> 00:05:37.392
Here, boy.
过来 小东西

00:05:37.592 --> 00:05:39.272
(CLICKING TONGUE)
过来 小东西

00:05:42.192 --> 00:05:45.192
I ain't gonna smell it,
if that's what you want.
如果你是想让我闻闻你的手
我可做不到

00:05:45.392 --> 00:05:46.392
(CHUCKLES)

00:05:46.912 --> 00:05:48.312
Sorry.
对不起

00:05:48.872 --> 00:05:50.392
Lucy Pevensie?
露西派文西？

00:05:55.432 --> 00:05:56.672
Yes?
我是

00:06:06.792 --> 00:06:08.272
That's the hankie I gave to Mr. Tum...
那是我的手绢 我送给吐…

00:06:08.432 --> 00:06:11.752
Tumnus. He got it to me
just before they took him.
吐纳思 他在被抓之前
把手绢交给了我

00:06:11.912 --> 00:06:13.592
Is he all right?
他还好吗？

00:06:14.672 --> 00:06:16.152
(WHISPERING) Further in.
到里面再说

00:06:18.392 --> 00:06:21.112
-What are you doing?
-She's right.
你在干什么？
她是对的

00:06:21.272 --> 00:06:23.592
How do we know we can trust him?
你怎么知道我们能相信他？

00:06:24.152 --> 00:06:26.032
He said he knows the faun.
他说他认识人羊

00:06:26.192 --> 00:06:29.512
He's a beaver.
He shouldn't be saying anything!
他是个海狸 他不应该会说话

00:06:30.072 --> 00:06:31.432
Everything all right?
一切都还好吧？

00:06:31.592 --> 00:06:33.832
Yes. We were just talking.
没事 我们只是说说话

00:06:34.512 --> 00:06:37.152
(WHISPERING) That's better left
for safer quarters.
最好等到了安全的地方再说

00:06:38.272 --> 00:06:40.072
He means the trees.
他指的是那些树

